elopment, and Evaluation (GRADE) approach\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Vaccine efficacy was calculated as (1 – [P / (1 – P)]) x 100%\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"When 95% CI not used, the CI was adjusted using the Bonferroni procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"All differences between vaccine group and placebo group were not statistically significant, as determined by nonoverlapping CIs\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}